  "project": "one comp 1920x1080 with an active camera, a solid with a mask, shape, text, pre-comp, footage, null, light and adjustment layers",
  "notes": [
   "Titles that AE builds from the project are kept as shown: 'Active Camera (Camera 1)', 'Reset Camera 1', 'Camera 1 Settings...'.",
   "AE ends the layer menu with 'Select ▸', the layers under the pointer (here only 'Red Solid 1'); it is not recorded.",
   "Effect ▸ lists the effect categories; their effects are the Effect menu's (docs/reference/ae/effects.md) and are left out here.",
   "The layer menu has the same entries for solid, shape, pre-comp layers, on a mask path and with several layers selected (only what is greyed differs); a camera's Transform ▸ has 'Point of Interest...' instead of 'Anchor Point...'. On the Mac the Timeline's layer menu is the same as the Composition panel's.",
   "Import Recent Footage ▸ lists the user's recent files; left out.",
   "Not read: the time ruler and the work area bar (no menu opened at the points tried), property names and values in the Timeline."
  ]
